  "job_B9.6.6_20251003_115103": {
    "chunk_text": ", \u00dea onfeng se gesii\u00f0 hine & his gyman dyde & his wunde het l\u00e6cnian. \u00dea he \u00f0a ongon trumian & haligan, \u00fea bebead he \u00fe\u00e6t hine mon gebunde, \u00fey l\u00e6s he on niht \u00dea ne meahte hine mon gebindan; for\u00f0on sona \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee heo onweg eodon, \u00fea \u00f0e hine bundon, H\u00e6fde he agenne bro\u00f0or m\u00e6ssepreost, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Tuna, se w\u00e6s abbud in \u00fe\u00e6m mynstre & Mid \u00fey he hine hyrde in \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte ofslegenne, \u00fea cwom he & sohte in \u00fe\u00e6m w\u00e6le his lic, \u00dea funde he o\u00f0erne \u00feurh eal \u00feing him \u00feone gelicestan, \u00fea tealde he \u00fe\u00e6t he hit w\u00e6re. B\u00e6r hine \u00fea to his mynstre, & arlice bebyrgde: ond fore alysnesse his sawle gelomlice \u00de\u00e6re m\u00e6rsunge w\u00e6s geworden, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00e6r cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hine n\u00e6nig mon meahte gebindan, ac sona Betweoh \u00fea \u00feing \u00fea eac se gesi\u00fe, se \u00f0e hine h\u00e6fde, ongon wundrian & hine frignan, for hwon Ond hine ascode hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00f0a alysendlecan rune cu\u00f0e, & \u00fea stafas mid him awritene h\u00e6fde, be \u00dea ondswarede he \u00fe\u00e6t he noht swylcra cr\u00e6fta ne cu\u00f0e. Ac ic h\u00e6bbe, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, in minre m\u00e6g\u00f0e minne bro\u00f0or m\u00e6ssepreost; ond ic wat, \u00fe\u00e6t he mec & gif ic nu in o\u00f0rum life w\u00e6re, \u00feonne w\u00e6re min sawl \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feurh his",
